{"id": "14886", "revid": "107092", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=14886", "title": "Hondo (Texas)", "text": "Hondo is a city in the Hill Country River Region of Texas.\nGet in.\nHondo is located about halfway between Sabinal and San Antonio on US 90. From Kerrville on I-10, you can also take Texas Highway 173 south past Bandera."}
